Error [E0112]: `guard.split` projections overlap
  --> local_cell_edit_guard_split_rejects_overlapping_paths.jet:6:9
    |
  6 |         pair -> pair.left
    |         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Each edit guard must cover a disjoint field of the original value
 Fix: Project two different fields, or keep one guard and edit through it
